WEBVTT

00:05.330 --> 00:08.250
Will nothing convince you, sire?

00:08.250 --> 00:12.310
Of course not. I refuse 
to accept your sophistry.

00:12.310 --> 00:15.580
Sophistry? You wound me, sire.

00:15.580 --> 00:22.320
At last night's ball, Lady Sariphi said 
herself that she is unfit to be queen.

00:22.650 --> 00:25.780
In other words, she abandoned her ordeal.

00:26.250 --> 00:32.510
We thus consider that she disqualified 
herself from queenship at that moment.

00:32.510 --> 00:36.660
But Sariphi performed her duties as hostess

00:36.660 --> 00:40.480
and ultimately won Duke Galois 
over to her cause.

00:40.730 --> 00:45.500
That took place after she 
renounced her ordeal.

00:45.980 --> 00:50.600
Whatever the outcome, you cannot 
deny that she refused queenship.

00:51.260 --> 00:57.120
I ask you, can such a half-hearted candidate 
be trusted with responsibility?

00:57.920 --> 01:05.320
In any case, we categorically refuse 
to recognize this ordeal as a success.

02:36.010 --> 02:41.010
Recollections of a King and His Chancellor

02:45.320 --> 02:46.690
Welcome back, Your Majesty!

02:48.800 --> 02:50.320
Are you all right?

02:50.320 --> 02:52.640
Merely a touch tired of quibbling.

02:53.060 --> 02:56.600
Was it about me again?

02:56.900 --> 02:59.970
You have nothing to worry about.

03:00.820 --> 03:03.630
<i>I shouldn't tell Sariphi.</i>

03:04.170 --> 03:06.980
<i>She may regret her actions if I do.</i>

03:08.060 --> 03:12.470
<i>I don't want to force any more 
constraints on her needlessly.</i>

03:15.050 --> 03:16.150
Sire.

03:17.310 --> 03:20.580
If something really is wrong, tell me. Okay?

03:24.200 --> 03:27.040
<i>One day, even he will understand.</i>

03:28.520 --> 03:29.050
Huh?

03:29.380 --> 03:31.360
The rest of this book is missing.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.550
Ichthyan history?

03:34.050 --> 03:37.370
This must have slipped in 
from another library.

03:37.370 --> 03:39.560
You mean this isn't the only one?

03:39.790 --> 03:41.310
Of course not.

03:41.310 --> 03:44.120
There are enough to fit the 
whole history of Ozmargo.

03:44.440 --> 03:50.090
There's even a forbidden library, 
which only royalty may enter!

03:50.090 --> 03:51.030
Enter!

03:51.030 --> 03:53.750
Really? A forbidden library?

03:53.990 --> 03:59.460
J-Just to be clear, "forbidden" 
means that you're not allowed in!

04:01.760 --> 04:06.560
We'll find the next volume of 
that book, Sari. You wait here.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.270
Here.

04:07.270 --> 04:10.060
What? Don't worry. I'll find it myself.

04:10.650 --> 04:13.770
I'm always making you two do all the work.

04:14.750 --> 04:17.520
<i>I'll check the nearest library first.</i>

04:17.950 --> 04:19.770
<i>I wonder where it is.</i>

04:20.880 --> 04:21.990
And then—

04:21.990 --> 04:22.730
You there!

04:23.160 --> 04:26.200
How dare you indulge in 
chitchat while on duty?!

04:26.200 --> 04:28.400
A-A thousand pardons, sir!

04:28.960 --> 04:33.650
Only truly devoted servants of His Majesty 
have a place in this palace!

04:33.650 --> 04:36.490
Remember that you can always be replaced!

04:36.750 --> 04:37.930
Y-Yes, sir!

04:37.930 --> 04:39.210
It won't happen again!

04:45.500 --> 04:49.390
That scared me half to death. 
He's been pricklier than ever lately.

04:49.390 --> 04:51.170
Not that I don't sympathize.

04:51.170 --> 04:54.270
Still, after seeing that ball,

04:54.670 --> 04:58.970
I wound up thinking that 
humans aren't all bad.

04:59.210 --> 05:03.240
<i>Fools. Don't they see her virtue is an act?</i>

05:03.920 --> 05:09.310
<i>That wench beguiled the king to escape 
being sacrificed and save her own skin.</i>

05:10.230 --> 05:12.450
<i>She can't pull the wool over </i>my<i> eyes.</i>

05:13.520 --> 05:17.870
<i>I must remove her from His Majesty's side,</i>

05:18.400 --> 05:20.950
<i>by any means necessary.</i>

05:23.250 --> 05:24.920
Mr. Chancellor!

05:26.150 --> 05:29.340
I'm so sorry for asking you to show 
me the way. I know you're busy.

05:29.340 --> 05:30.380
Don't mention it.

05:30.380 --> 05:32.630
Still, look at all these books.

05:33.250 --> 05:35.980
How will I ever find the one I want?

05:36.260 --> 05:39.830
<i>I don't know how she seduced His Majesty,</i>

05:39.830 --> 05:43.580
<i>but I swear... I will end her life.</i>

05:45.290 --> 05:46.690
<i>End her life?!</i>

05:47.000 --> 05:52.670
<i>I could do it now. No one else 
knows that we're here.</i>

05:53.070 --> 05:57.410
<i>It would be easy to engineer an accident 
amid all these bookshelves.</i>

05:57.880 --> 05:59.540
<i>I can kill her!</i>

06:00.160 --> 06:03.010
<i>I have no reason to hesitate. None!</i>

06:05.280 --> 06:07.420
Oh, Mr. Chancellor!

06:08.180 --> 06:09.660
Are you all right?!

06:09.660 --> 06:12.340
Don't worry. I'll keep looking on my own.

06:12.340 --> 06:14.890
No, allow me to assist you.

06:14.890 --> 06:16.100
Really?

06:16.900 --> 06:18.360
Thank goodness.

06:19.500 --> 06:23.390
To be honest, I wanted to 
solve this problem myself,

06:23.390 --> 06:27.040
but with you on my side, 
I'll have nothing to worry about!

06:27.480 --> 06:28.750
Thank you.

06:29.800 --> 06:32.070
<i>Is she dim-witted?</i>

06:32.640 --> 06:36.570
<i>She has no sense of danger. 
Her folly is stunning.</i>

06:36.570 --> 06:39.040
<i>I'll finish her quickly,</i>

06:39.440 --> 06:44.610
<i>with these hands I swore to 
devote wholly to His Majesty.</i>

06:45.910 --> 06:46.880
Mr. Chancellor!

06:47.350 --> 06:48.790
Mr. Chancellor!

06:51.460 --> 06:54.050
Master! Master Sirius!

06:54.460 --> 06:56.920
Your lord father's funeral is about to begin.

06:57.340 --> 06:59.030
It's time for you to dress.

06:59.990 --> 07:01.370
I won't go.

07:01.640 --> 07:03.610
What do you mean?

07:03.610 --> 07:09.390
This funeral is where you will formally 
inherit the name of Anubis.

07:10.370 --> 07:12.140
That's the problem.

07:12.140 --> 07:15.000
I don't want to become 
the royal family's lapdog.

07:15.550 --> 07:17.460
Listen well, Sirius.

07:17.460 --> 07:20.190
Generation after generation, 
we of the line of Anubis

07:20.190 --> 07:24.760
have lived to serve and 
protect the royal family.

07:25.080 --> 07:31.830
Your blood and your life exist to 
be sacrificed to the king one day.

07:32.680 --> 07:36.020
My father never stopped telling me that,

07:36.020 --> 07:39.700
and he died saving the king from assassins.

07:40.420 --> 07:44.670
But his death didn't move the royals one bit.

07:44.670 --> 07:47.970
They only thought of him as one lost pawn.

07:48.780 --> 07:54.630
You're Anubis's boy? I hear you 
didn't attend his funeral.

07:54.630 --> 07:58.250
Yes, Your Majesty. I took ill.

07:58.600 --> 08:04.990
Well, no matter. You're too young 
to assume his duties in any case.

08:05.510 --> 08:09.090
Henceforth, I command you 
to attend on the prince.

08:09.600 --> 08:11.380
As you wish, sire.

08:12.580 --> 08:16.320
My name is Sirius. It's a pleasure to 
make Your Highness's acquaintance.

08:16.320 --> 08:19.180
Sirius? I thought you were Anubis.

08:19.490 --> 08:23.910
I have not yet formally inherited that name.

08:24.360 --> 08:29.520
<i>Ha! Why would I ever take a name 
that makes me your servant?</i>

08:29.740 --> 08:30.800
Oh, I see.

08:31.280 --> 08:33.320
Nice to meet you, Sirius.

08:41.540 --> 08:43.830
<i>I swear I'll rise to greatness.</i>

08:44.670 --> 08:48.310
<i>I'll study my head off, and someday 
I'll be the greatest in the kingdom.</i>

08:48.310 --> 08:51.290
<i>Even more important than royalty.</i>

08:51.570 --> 08:54.090
<i>And to make that happen, I'll do anything...</i>

08:57.430 --> 08:58.740
What is it?

09:01.780 --> 09:03.540
What about them?

09:03.540 --> 09:05.730
It would be a shame to step on them.

09:07.000 --> 09:07.810
Pardon?

09:08.390 --> 09:13.350
With all due respect, hundred-eyed ants 
are incapable of fearing death.

09:13.550 --> 09:18.350
Stepping on one or two will 
hardly drive them extinct,

09:18.350 --> 09:21.700
and they lack the intelligence 
to mourn their fellows.

09:21.950 --> 09:25.990
Only proper culling allows 
both plants and animals

09:25.990 --> 09:29.100
to maintain a healthy circle of life.

09:29.100 --> 09:35.180
Naïve and misplaced pity for them 
is the true danger to our ecosystem.

09:35.730 --> 09:38.850
I see. You sure are smart.

09:41.060 --> 09:43.030
Then did you know...

09:43.580 --> 09:47.730
that hundred-eyed ants always 
follow the ant in the lead?

09:48.370 --> 09:49.430
That's better.

09:51.190 --> 09:55.870
Why step on them when you can go around?

09:58.070 --> 10:01.940
<i>Yes, that's all well and good for royalty.</i>

10:02.780 --> 10:07.700
<i>You get to choose whether 
you crush others underfoot.</i>

10:12.000 --> 10:14.770
Your Highness, where have you been?

10:14.770 --> 10:16.640
It's time for your swordsmanship lessons.

10:16.890 --> 10:19.010
I hate swords.

10:19.010 --> 10:20.820
What lily-livered nonsense.

10:20.820 --> 10:24.640
Your Highness will lead troops 
into battle yourself someday.

10:25.020 --> 10:28.280
But getting hit with a wooden sword hurts.

10:28.280 --> 10:31.320
Getting cut with a real sword 
must be even worse.

10:31.780 --> 10:36.060
Have no fear. Your Highness 
will be struck last of all.

10:36.470 --> 10:39.160
Your minions will be the first to die.

10:39.870 --> 10:43.690
Friend or foe, everyone feels 
pain when they get hurt.

10:44.550 --> 10:49.140
We should just make a country where 
no one, of any race, has to fight.

10:50.370 --> 10:53.580
Yes, that would be wonderful.

10:54.170 --> 10:56.520
<i>Fanciful idealism.</i>

10:56.850 --> 11:03.180
<i>And only those able to truly face 
reality can realize their ideals.</i>

11:09.520 --> 11:12.220
<i>I see the world as it really is.</i>

11:12.220 --> 11:14.730
<i>One day, I'll be unrivaled in this realm.</i>

11:14.730 --> 11:20.350
<i>Maybe not during the current king's reign, 
but once this spoiled prince succeeds him,</i>

11:21.160 --> 11:22.540
<i>my time will come.</i>

11:27.240 --> 11:29.560
<i>I need to study.</i>

11:29.970 --> 11:32.840
<i>I don't have time to rest.</i>

11:33.340 --> 11:35.830
The young master has a fever again.

11:35.830 --> 11:38.980
He's never been strong.

11:38.980 --> 11:42.160
Of course, I'm sure waiting on 
the prince is tiring, but still...

11:42.160 --> 11:45.670
Will he really be able to 
succeed his late father?

11:45.980 --> 11:49.180
<i>Shut up, shut up, shut up!</i>

11:49.560 --> 11:52.180
<i>I'll never follow in my father's footsteps!</i>

11:52.730 --> 11:58.180
<i>He never once came to 
visit me when I was ill!</i>

11:58.760 --> 12:02.790
<i>His duty meant more to him than I did!</i>

12:07.720 --> 12:08.670
<i>What's this?</i>

12:09.700 --> 12:11.380
<i>It's warm...</i>

12:13.420 --> 12:15.990
Your Highness?! What are you doing here?!

12:15.990 --> 12:20.550
I heard you weren't feeling well, 
so I came to check on you.

12:21.930 --> 12:23.810
You came all this way alone?!

12:24.570 --> 12:27.090
I'm sure no one spotted me.

12:28.260 --> 12:31.180
I brought you healthy food from the kitchens.

12:31.760 --> 12:34.110
Eat plenty, and get well.

12:34.790 --> 12:38.360
Wh-Why have you done all this?

12:38.360 --> 12:42.940
Huh? Can't I worry about you?

12:43.290 --> 12:44.010
<i>Huh?</i>

12:44.630 --> 12:49.530
<i>Worried? The prince is actually concerned</i>

12:50.340 --> 12:53.330
<i>about me, a mere vassal?</i>

12:55.020 --> 12:56.460
Besides,

12:56.870 --> 13:00.660
your father saved mine.

13:02.020 --> 13:05.520
My father is strict and scary,

13:06.000 --> 13:09.060
but I still love him.

13:10.650 --> 13:13.550
So I'm grateful. Really, I am.

13:14.540 --> 13:17.880
<i>Oh, so that's it.</i>

13:19.620 --> 13:21.260
I have no need of this.

13:21.260 --> 13:21.680
Huh?

13:21.960 --> 13:23.520
Kindly return to your chambers.

13:23.820 --> 13:24.880
Sirius?

13:24.880 --> 13:26.430
You mustn't linger.

13:26.430 --> 13:27.230
Wait, Sirius.

13:27.230 --> 13:29.200
Please just leave already!

13:33.820 --> 13:35.840
The prince has been kidnapped!

13:35.840 --> 13:38.350
And the son of the late Anubis with him!

13:38.350 --> 13:41.010
Organize a search party at once!

13:50.830 --> 13:51.930
Where...

13:55.760 --> 13:56.820
Your Highness!

13:57.180 --> 13:58.080
Huh?

13:58.080 --> 14:00.280
Oh, one of the brats woke up.

14:00.280 --> 14:04.830
Thanks. We couldn't have taken 
the prince hostage without you.

14:05.120 --> 14:08.030
Now we can get our comrades set free.

14:08.030 --> 14:10.870
Then we really will take the king's head.

14:10.870 --> 14:12.550
No more screw-ups!

14:12.830 --> 14:16.280
<i>These are the assassins 
who targeted the king?!</i>

14:16.760 --> 14:18.240
<i>That means...</i>

14:18.240 --> 14:19.120
Yowch!

14:19.490 --> 14:21.450
What's the big idea?!

14:21.450 --> 14:23.880
Give back my father!

14:23.880 --> 14:26.080
Huh?! What'd you say to me?!

14:28.510 --> 14:30.940
So you're Anubis's brat!

14:30.940 --> 14:34.520
Anubises die as the shadows of royalty.

14:34.520 --> 14:38.980
If you've got their blood in your veins, 
this must be fate.

14:38.980 --> 14:43.440
Why do you think we took you 
and not just the prince?

14:43.750 --> 14:49.150
So we can kill a kid to 
show we mean business.

14:49.440 --> 14:54.590
The prince is our ace in the hole, 
but you're worthless as a hostage.

14:54.590 --> 14:58.260
This is for your prince. 
Don't you feel honored?

14:58.260 --> 15:01.960
If you wanna blame someone, 
blame the royals who drove us to this,

15:01.960 --> 15:03.840
and blame your own blood.

15:10.170 --> 15:12.070
Y-Your Highness!

15:15.330 --> 15:17.000
<i>Royal blood.</i>

15:17.710 --> 15:20.420
<i>A royal is shielding a vassal.</i>

15:20.910 --> 15:21.950
<i>No...</i>

15:22.820 --> 15:26.690
<i>It's unpardonable. I'm done for.</i>

15:27.420 --> 15:30.330
<i>This is the end for me!</i>

15:30.330 --> 15:33.250
Moron! <i>That's</i> the kid you wanna kill!

15:33.250 --> 15:35.150
Y-Yeah, I know!

15:38.270 --> 15:42.520
Y-Your Highness! Please stop this!

15:42.520 --> 15:44.620
A future king should not put himself in peril!

15:44.620 --> 15:48.100
A king is someone... who protects everyone.

15:49.700 --> 15:55.740
If I can't protect... even one friend... 
right in front of me...

15:56.620 --> 15:58.480
what kind of king am I?!

16:07.630 --> 16:09.090
Your Highness!

16:09.090 --> 16:11.000
Your Highness, please stay strong!

16:11.360 --> 16:16.380
Sirius... Are you... hurt?

16:17.460 --> 16:19.280
N-No.

16:20.450 --> 16:21.940
I'm glad.

16:30.980 --> 16:32.260
<i>I must escape.</i>

16:32.900 --> 16:35.410
<i>I must get away while they're unconscious.</i>

16:35.410 --> 16:36.420
<i>I must...</i>

16:36.870 --> 16:38.400
<i>protect the prince!</i>

16:39.850 --> 16:41.970
I sensed magic up ahead!

16:42.880 --> 16:46.370
There he is! Lord Anubis's son is with him!

16:47.160 --> 16:50.030
Hurry... Get His Highness to...

16:52.880 --> 16:55.810
I'm so glad you weren't hurt.

16:56.110 --> 17:00.620
They say the prince will recover 
with a few days of rest.

17:01.260 --> 17:02.340
I see.

17:02.750 --> 17:07.970
And I hear the prince 
made a plea to His Majesty.

17:07.970 --> 17:12.510
He begged for you not to be held accountable.

17:13.690 --> 17:17.170
So the house of Anubis's 
reputation will not suffer.

17:17.170 --> 17:19.420
Isn't that wonderful?

17:20.990 --> 17:22.120
<i>I...</i>

17:23.010 --> 17:26.730
<i>I had only thought of myself 
until it came to that.</i>

17:28.710 --> 17:31.930
<i>But I finally understand, Father.</i>

17:32.460 --> 17:34.750
<i>Are you out there somewhere, watching me?</i>

17:35.620 --> 17:39.340
<i>I've found my king, too.</i>

17:40.860 --> 17:42.720
What's wrong, Sirius?

17:43.210 --> 17:48.810
Although I serve Your Highness, 
I was unable to defend you the other day.

17:48.810 --> 17:51.120
I humbly beg your forgiveness.

17:51.120 --> 17:52.800
Don't worry about it.

17:52.800 --> 17:56.330
I was the one who got you 
involved in the first place.

17:56.640 --> 17:58.040
So I should apologize to—

17:58.040 --> 18:03.180
Your Highness, royalty must not 
utter words of apology lightly.

18:03.180 --> 18:07.840
And endangering yourself to shield others, 
as you did on this occasion,

18:08.330 --> 18:10.650
is a rash and thoughtless act.

18:11.090 --> 18:13.540
Please be more circumspect in future.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.660
Sirius?

18:16.240 --> 18:17.230
No.

18:17.820 --> 18:19.840
I am Anubis.

18:19.840 --> 18:24.440
As your shadow, I shall henceforth 
devote myself wholly to Your Highness.

18:26.580 --> 18:34.660
<i>I'll do anything to make him a strong, 
stern, and absolute monarch.</i>

18:35.160 --> 18:36.000
<i>Even if that means</i>

18:36.470 --> 18:40.210
<i>I may never again feel his warmth.</i>

18:44.050 --> 18:45.370
<i>What's this?</i>

18:46.040 --> 18:47.090
<i>It's warm...</i>

18:49.300 --> 18:51.090
<i>Your Highness?</i>

18:54.980 --> 18:56.860
You're finally awake!

18:56.860 --> 18:58.950
How do you feel, Mr. Chancellor?

18:59.240 --> 19:00.850
W-Wen—

19:02.520 --> 19:03.900
<i>I've never been so ashamed!</i>

19:04.410 --> 19:07.720
<i>How could I have seen 
His Majesty in this wench?</i>

19:08.450 --> 19:11.360
Lady Sariphi, what is the meaning of this?

19:11.820 --> 19:14.120
You collapsed all of a sudden in the library.

19:14.660 --> 19:16.680
But you feel better now, right?

19:16.680 --> 19:17.870
Don't touch me!

19:18.500 --> 19:20.750
Do you imagine this places me in your debt?

19:20.750 --> 19:21.890
Despicable.

19:22.160 --> 19:28.720
You'd flatter anyone to ensure your 
own survival, vile human wench!

19:29.220 --> 19:33.310
You may have fooled His Majesty 
with your wiles, but you won't fool me!

19:33.310 --> 19:40.000
I won't stand for an upstart human girl 
to further disturb his royal heart!

19:40.000 --> 19:43.570
I will <i>never</i> accept you!

19:47.590 --> 19:50.490
Oh, good! I'm so relieved!

19:50.490 --> 19:52.880
You're finally acting like yourself again!

19:54.060 --> 19:54.810
What?

19:54.810 --> 19:58.570
I mean, when you started going, 
"Lady Sariphi..." earlier,

19:58.570 --> 20:00.390
it was downright uncanny.

20:01.530 --> 20:02.550
Besides,

20:02.850 --> 20:04.930
His Majesty worries about you, too.

20:06.440 --> 20:08.390
Don't act as if you know him!

20:08.680 --> 20:13.080
It's a thousand years too soon 
for you to speak on his behalf!

20:13.510 --> 20:16.840
You know nothing of all 
that has passed between us!

20:16.840 --> 20:19.200
No, I don't.

20:20.160 --> 20:26.030
But I've watched His Majesty, 
and I can tell what he cares about.

20:28.410 --> 20:30.290
He may not show it on his face,

20:30.290 --> 20:33.030
but he worries a lot about you, Mr. Chancellor.

20:34.010 --> 20:37.950
So get well soon and think up 
my next ordeal, okay?

20:47.080 --> 20:47.990
Your—

20:54.590 --> 20:56.610
<i>See? I knew it.</i>

20:59.630 --> 21:01.900
...think up my next ordeal, okay?

21:06.570 --> 21:10.520
Now, permit us to open this council.

21:10.520 --> 21:16.710
As to the treatment of Lady Sariphi, 
which we so recently discussed—

21:16.710 --> 21:17.860
My Lord Speakers.

21:19.030 --> 21:22.170
On this occasion, let us respect the royal will

21:22.170 --> 21:25.080
and consider that she has 
succeeded in her ordeal.

21:26.390 --> 21:32.150
I move that we continue to test 
Lady Sariphi's worthiness as a consort.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.780
Are you certain that's wise?

21:35.780 --> 21:37.650
I stand by what I have said.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.530
<i>Wench.</i>

21:42.180 --> 21:45.640
<i>Henceforth, I will judge you in earnest</i>

21:45.640 --> 21:50.490
<i>to see whether you are 
worthy of my king's heart.</i>

21:51.470 --> 21:53.350
<i>Be prepared.</i>

